### 5. Scientific Limitations and Considerations

The team recognized that satellite observations cannot directly measure submarine groundwater discharge or independently determine safe groundwater extraction volumes.

Therefore, satellite-derived indicators must be evaluated together with field measurements, hydrogeological information, and environmental data.

AQUAVEIN-SAR is intended to provide preliminary assessments and decision-support information rather than definitive groundwater measurements or extraction permissions.

